          "headline": "Iran's IRGC says two tankers and a tugboat caught fire in Strait of Hormuz",
          "summary": "Iran's Revolutionary Guards say one tanker hit a mine while using a passage south of the strait that Iran calls unauthorised, and a supertanker caught fire leaving the route in the east; a tug that went to help also caught fire. The IRGC blames the US for encouraging ships to use the mined route and says it also took control of two US drones. Ship names, owners and any casualties have not been given.",
