          "id": "markets-sensex-surges-midday-2026-11-05",
          "headline": "Sensex jumps about 1,850 points to 79,156 as oil slump and US vote lift stocks",
          "summary": "Indian shares extended their winning streak to a sixth day. At about 1:30 pm the Sensex was up roughly 2.4% at 79,156 and the Nifty up 2.4% at 24,531, after a gap-up open to a 10-week high. Auto, financials and cement led; Shriram Finance, IndiGo, Bajaj Finance and Maruti were among top gainers, while ONGC and Coal India fell. Brent's 8% drop and the Democratic sweep, seen as raising pressure to end the Iran war, drove the rally.",
